title: Remove `pallet-scarcity`
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    `pallet-scarcity` and its `AsScarcity` transaction extension have been removed
    from the Polkadot SDK. The pallet was added in #12730 and has not been part of
    any release. It now lives in the `individuality-community` repository.

    The development (`kitchensink`) runtime no longer includes the pallet, and its
    `TxExtension` no longer wraps `AuthorizeCall` with `AsScarcity`.

    Users of the `polkadot-sdk` umbrella crate should remove the `pallet-scarcity`
    feature from their dependency declaration.
crates:
- name: polkadot-sdk
  bump: major
